  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedText
  textoPT: "Eu lembro vividamente\u2026\nO primeiro inverno juntos.\nEla comemorava
    25 anos quando eu me ajoelhei e pedi sua m\xE3o.\n\nEla disse sim.\n\n"
  textoEN: 'I remember it vividly...

    Our first winter together.

    She was
    celebrating her 25th birthday when I got down on one knee and asked for her hand.


    She
    said yes.'
  useLayoutOverride: 0
